t Squirrel Canyon, north of Hildale, UT.','2025-03-27 22:32:34','2025-03-27 22:32:34'),(9987,'trails',30,'What is the major landmark hikers will encounter?','One of the main highlights of the hike is the amazing Eye of Heaven Arch, located at Eye of Heaven Arch Park.','2025-03-27 22:32:34','2025-03-27 22:32:34'),(9988,'trails',30,'What are the geographic coordinates for the trailhead?','The coordinates for the trailhead are approximately 37.0263 latitude and -112.953 longitude.','2025-03-27 22:32:34','2025-03-27 22:32:34'),(9989,'trails',31,'What is the Shakespeare Arch on the Sentinel Trail?','Shakespeare Arch is a stunning natural feature along the Sentinel Trail that offers spectacular views of Utah\'s diverse landscapes.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9990,'trails',31,'Is the Sentinel Trail family-friendly?','Yes, the trail is considered family-friendly, especially if everyone stays well-hydrated during the hike.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9991,'trails',31,'What is the total length of the Sentinel Trail?','The loop trail covers a distance of 1.6 miles.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9992,'trails',31,'What level of difficulty can hikers expect on the Sentinel Trail?','The trail is rated as intermediate to difficult due to the elevation changes and terrain.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9993,'trails',31,'What are the elevation details for the Sentinel Trail?','The trail starts and ends at an elevation of 5,881 feet, with a total incline of 223 feet and a decline of 218 feet.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9994,'trails',31,'What is the average and maximum grade of the Sentinel Trail?','The average grade is about 0.05%, while the maximum grade reaches up to 0.38%.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9995,'trails',31,'What features can hikers enjoy while on the Sentinel Trail?','Hikers can enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of Utah\'s beautiful landscapes throughout the hike.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9996,'trails',31,'Are dogs allowed on the Sentinel Trail?','The policy regarding dogs on the trail is currently unknown.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9997,'trails',31,'What are the geographic coordinates of the Sentinel Trail?','The latitude and longitude for the trail are 37.5106 and -111.978, respectively.','2025-03-27 22:32:40','2025-03-27 22:32:40'),(9998,'trails',33,'What is the name of the trail?','The trail is called the Panorama Trail - Cool Cave Loop.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(9999,'trails',33,'Where is the Panorama Trail located?','This trail is situated in Kodachrome Basin State Park.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10000,'trails',33,'What can I expect to see on the Panorama Trail?','Hikers can enjoy striking rock formations and stunning panoramic views throughout the loop.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10001,'trails',33,'What is the difficulty level of the Panorama Trail?','The trail is rated as intermediate in difficulty.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10002,'trails',33,'What is the total length of the Panorama Trail?','The loop measures approximately 0.9 miles.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10003,'trails',33,'What is the highest elevation on the trail?','The trail reaches a highest elevation of 5,770 feet.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10004,'trails',33,'What is the lowest elevation on the trail?','The lowest elevation is also 5,770 feet, indicating a relatively flat terrain.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10005,'trails',33,'What are the incline and decline measurements on this trail?','The trail features an incline of 71 feet and a decline of 72 feet.','2025-03-27 22:32:48','2025-03-27 22:32:48'),(10006,'trails',33,'What is the average grade of the Panorama Trail?','The trail has an average grade of 0.03%, making it quite manageable for most hikers.','2025-03-27 22:3