et, providing a gentle terrain.','2025-03-27 22:32:55','2025-03-27 22:32:55'),(10016,'trails',34,'What is the average and maximum grade of the trail?','The average grade of the Grand Parade Trail is 0.02%, with a maximum grade of 0.06%, indicating a very gentle slope throughout the hike.','2025-03-27 22:32:55','2025-03-27 22:32:55'),(10017,'trails',34,'What features can hikers expect to see on the trail?','While exploring the Grand Parade Trail, hikers can enjoy delightful views and may also spot wildflowers along the route.','2025-03-27 22:32:55','2025-03-27 22:32:55'),(10018,'trails',34,'Are dogs allowed on the Grand Parade Trail?','Yes, dogs are permitted on the trail as long as they are kept on a leash.','2025-03-27 22:32:55','2025-03-27 22:32:55'),(10019,'trails',34,'What are the geographic coordinates of the Grand Parade Trail?','The Grand Parade Trail is located at a latitude of 37.5228 and a longitude of -111.992.','2025-03-27 22:32:55','2025-03-27 22:32:55'),(10020,'trails',35,'Is the Alpine Pond Trail suitable for families?','Absolutely! The Alpine Pond Trail is designed to be family-friendly, featuring a scenic loop with gradual inclines that makes it accessible for hikers of all ages.','2025-03-27 22:33:07','2025-03-27 22:33:07'),(10021,'trails',35,'What kind of terrain can I expect on the trail?','The trail offers a gently rolling terrain, perfect for a pleasant walk. With gradual grades, it\'s easy for hikers to enjoy the stunning views without too much exertion.','2025-03-27 22:33:07','2025-03-27 22:33:07'),(10022,'trails',35,'How long is the Alpine Pond Trail?','The entire scenic loop spans approximately 2.2 miles, providing a delightful experience for both casual walkers and more experienced hikers.','2025-03-27 22:33:07','2025-03-27 22:33:07'),(10023,'trails',35,'Can I shorten my hike on the Alpine Pond Trail?','Yes! The trail features multiple access points and has a cutoff option, allowing you to shorten your hike if needed.','2025-03-27 22:33:07