t, making it suitable for those with some experience.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11345,'trails',127,'What is the total length of the Spring Creek Route?','The trail stretches for 3.2 miles from start to finish.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11346,'trails',127,'What are the elevation details for the Spring Creek Route?','This trail starts and ends at the same elevation of 5617 feet. It features a total incline of 912 feet and a minimal decline of just 9 feet.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11347,'trails',127,'What type of trail is the Spring Creek Route?','The Spring Creek Route is a point-to-point trail, which means you will need to return to the starting point after your hike.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11348,'trails',127,'What is the average grade of the Spring Creek Route?','The trail has an average grade of 0.05%, indicating a gentle overall incline.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11349,'trails',127,'What is the maximum grade encountered on the Spring Creek Route?','Hikers can expect a maximum grade of 0.37% during their trek.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11350,'trails',127,'What are the geographic coordinates of the Spring Creek Route?','The trail is located at a latitude of 37.5215 and a longitude of -113.184.','2025-03-27 22:56:23','2025-03-27 22:56:23'),(11351,'trails',132,'What type of trail is the Cobra Arch Trail?','The Cobra Arch Trail is a point-to-point trail that offers a scenic hike along the rim of Paria Canyon before descending to view a remarkable sandstone arch.','2025-03-27 22:56:29','2025-03-27 22:56:29'),(11352,'trails',132,'How long is the Cobra Arch Trail?','This trail spans a length of 3.5 miles, providing hikers with a manageable yet rewarding trek.','2025-03-27 22:56:29','2025-03-27 22:56:29'),(11353,'trails',132,'What is the difficulty level of this trail?','The trail is rated as intermediate, making it suitable for hikers with some