 Roll trail?','The average grade of the trail is around 0.03%, with a maximum grade peaking at 0.14%.','2025-03-28 00:10:49','2025-03-28 00:10:49'),(12650,'trails',177,'Can you describe the trail type of Barrel Roll?','Barrel Roll is a loop trail, which can be navigated in either a clockwise or counter-clockwise direction.','2025-03-28 00:10:49','2025-03-28 00:10:49'),(12651,'trails',177,'What features can I expect to see on the trail?','Along the Barrel Roll trail, hikers will encounter beautiful views and the potential for wildflower sightings, especially in blooming seasons.','2025-03-28 00:10:49','2025-03-28 00:10:49'),(12652,'trails',177,'Are dogs allowed on the Barrel Roll trail?','The policy regarding dogs on the Barrel Roll trail is currently unknown.','2025-03-28 00:10:49','2025-03-28 00:10:49'),(12653,'trails',177,'How does the trail interact with the surrounding communities?','Despite being in close proximity to Santa Clara and Ivins, the Barrel Roll trail provides a secluded hiking experience where suburban life feels distant.','2025-03-28 00:10:49','2025-03-28 00:10:49'),(12654,'trails',177,'What is the general hiking experience like on this trail?','Hikers will find Barrel Roll to be well-marked and easy to maintain a steady pace, making it an enjoyable route for those seeking moderate exercise with rewarding views.','2025-03-28 00:10:49','2025-03-28 00:10:49'),(12655,'trails',178,'What is the Sidewinder Trail known for?','The Sidewinder Trail is celebrated for its breathtaking vistas, as it traverses a narrow mesa and features winding switchbacks that enhance the scenic experience.','2025-03-28 00:10:56','2025-03-28 00:10:56'),(12656,'trails',178,'What is the difficulty level of the Sidewinder Trail?','The Sidewinder Trail is categorized as an intermediate hike, making it suitable for those with some prior hiking experience.','2025-03-28 00:10:56','2025-03-28 00:10:56'),(12657,'trails',178,'What is the total distance of the Sidewinder Trail?','The trail stretches for 1.7 miles, providing a compact yet rewarding hiking experience.','2025-03-28 00:10:56','2025-03-28 00:10:56'),(12658,'trails',178,'What are the elevation details for the Sidewinder Trail?','The trail starts and ends at an elevation of 3,291 feet, with a total incline of 372 feet and a minor decline of 44 feet.','2025-03-28 00:10:56','2025-03-28 00:10:56'),(12659,'trails',178,'What type of trail is the Sidewinder Trail?','The Sidewinder Trail is a point-to-point hike, which means you will need to have transportation arranged to return to your starting point.','2025-03-28 00:10:57','2025-03-28 00:10:57'),(12660,'trails',178,'What is the average grade of the Sidewinder Trail?','The average grade of the trail is approximately 0.05%, making it relatively gentle in terms of steepness.','2025-03-28 00:10:57','2025-03-28 00:10:57'),(12661,'trails',178,'What is the maximum grade encountered on the Sidewinder Trail?','Hikers can expect a maximum grade of up to 0.09%, which contributes to the trail\'s overall intermediate classification.','2025-03-28 00:10:57','2025-03-28 00:10:57'),(12662,'trails',178,'What are the GPS coordinates of the Sidewinder Trail?','The Sidewinder Trail is located at latitude 37.1233 and longitude -113.686.','2025-03-28 00:10:57','2025-03-28 00:10:57'),(12663,'trails',182,'What is the length of the Kentucky Lucky Chicken Trail?','The Kentucky Lucky Chicken Trail is approximately 3.9 miles long.','2025-03-28 00:11:03','2025-03-28 00:11:03'),(12664,'trails',182,'How difficult is the Kentucky Lucky Chicken Trail?','This trail is considered to be of intermediate to difficult level, making it suitable for experienced hikers.','2025-03-28 00:11:03','2025-03-28 00:11:03'),(12665,'trails',182,'What type of trail is the Kentucky Lucky Chicken Trail?','The trail is a loop, allowing you to experience the full route without retracing your steps.','2025-03-28 00:11:03','2025-03-28 00:11:03'),(12666,'trails',182,'What is the elevation range on the 